ples with pairs, would strip the hand of pairs and leave 5 weak singles, making the Landlord extremely vulnerable to opponent pair plays.\n\nReason: This move clears the most problematic low cards (6, 7, J) in a single turn and establishes a strong hand structure with pairs and high cards for defense and re-entry.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♠4", "♥5", "♦6", "♣7", "♥8", "♣9", "♥10", "♦J"]}'}
